WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.101 --> 00:00:02.936
If Bob knew a documentary
was being made about him,

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:04.737
<i> he would act like
 he didn't like it,</i>

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:07.072
and he would love
every minute of it.

00:00:07.106 --> 00:00:08.508
LARRY DAVID: Hey, Funkhouser!

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:12.078
I think he'd get a kick
out of the fact that I
have to sit here and do this,

00:00:12.411 --> 00:00:13.579
knowing that
I really don't want to.

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:16.148
I think he would love it.
And I think he would

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:19.084
want to be in it,
mostly by himself.

00:00:19.184 --> 00:00:20.353
(LAUGHS)

00:00:20.753 --> 00:00:21.688
Ah...

00:00:23.255 --> 00:00:26.125
There was my brother, Cliff,
Bob, and myself.

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:29.596
Nobody thought Bob was gonna be
any kind of an entertainer.

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:31.464
Did you stick a gerbil
up your ass?

00:00:31.597 --> 00:00:32.998
-Who told you that?
-It's not important.

00:00:33.265 --> 00:00:35.468
-No, of course I didn't
stick a gerbil up my ass!
-Don't get so upset.

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:37.370
STEVE MARTIN:<i> From</i>
Smothers Brothers Comedy Hour,

00:00:37.503 --> 00:00:39.772
we were as close as
two people could be.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:42.275
Being a guy
who loves physical comedy,

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:45.845
<i> Super Dave</i> was
must-watch-TV for me growing up.

00:00:46.879 --> 00:00:48.047
MIKE WALDEN: Punch the bag!

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:49.648
CHILD: Can I have
your autograph?

00:00:49.782 --> 00:00:51.650
Sure-- Holy shit!

00:00:51.717 --> 00:00:52.785
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:52.885 --> 00:00:54.787
(LAUGHING)

00:00:55.454 --> 00:00:57.557
I was obsessed with him
instantly.

00:00:57.990 --> 00:00:59.792
He was always very dry.

00:00:59.892 --> 00:01:04.864
He mixed his corny old-jokes
with this weird, angry approach.

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:08.167
The straight man's usually what
the funny man bounces off of.

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:09.035
But he's both.

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:11.337
Did you take the flowers
at my mother's site?

00:01:11.403 --> 00:01:14.541
-There's so many of them,
I didn't know--
-So many of them?

00:01:14.641 --> 00:01:16.475
-Is that such a bad thing?
-You're not there to pick.

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:20.346
If you're lucky enough
to have a thing that works...

00:01:20.479 --> 00:01:22.682
-Jerry, Marty Funkhouser.
-Hey, Marty, how you doing?

00:01:22.815 --> 00:01:23.683
...that's your thing.

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:25.084
You don't need more
than one thing.

00:01:25.184 --> 00:01:29.155
-(LAUGHING)
-He had a big personailty,
but a big love.

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:32.225
It was Bob's world,
we're only living in it.

00:01:32.491 --> 00:01:34.827
<i> ♪ I landed on my head ♪</i>

00:01:35.327 --> 00:01:37.330
<i> ♪ Landed on my head </i>

